WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 34]

01:42.230 --> 01:42.930
Tang Lianyue!

01:43.280 --> 01:43.930
Don't touch him!

01:52.510 --> 01:53.180
That was too dangerous.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.260
Our opponents are tough.

01:54.270 --> 01:55.030
We should retreat for now.

01:55.760 --> 01:56.490
- But... - Let's go!

02:04.640 --> 02:06.130
You were hit by his Poison Palm.

02:06.590 --> 02:08.010
Even if you're the Xuanwu Guardian,

02:08.590 --> 02:10.100
there's no way you can resume the fight.

02:11.590 --> 02:12.260
Let's retreat for now.

02:12.630 --> 02:13.290
We'll think of something later.

02:25.360 --> 02:27.850
Xuanwu Guardian of Tianqi City...

02:29.840 --> 02:31.260
He's extraordinary indeed.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.340
He would've taken my life

02:35.310 --> 02:37.380
if you guys were one step later.

02:39.190 --> 02:39.980
Don't you agree?

02:42.310 --> 02:43.730
You would've died long ago

02:44.430 --> 02:45.660
had he used his hidden weapons.

02:46.080 --> 02:48.130
If so, why didn't he use them?

02:48.560 --> 02:49.890
Tang Lianyue is very intelligent.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.660
He found out about the identities

02:51.710 --> 02:52.730
of the people here.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.890
He guessed that we came here

02:55.240 --> 02:56.610
to deal with Prince of Langya.

02:56.870 --> 02:58.100
If he killed any of us

02:58.590 --> 03:00.060
and left his hidden weapons here during the process,

03:00.800 --> 03:01.450
perhaps

03:01.750 --> 03:02.660
it would become an indication

03:02.710 --> 03:04.290
that he was after Prince of Langya.

03:09.630 --> 03:10.850
What should we do with them, then?

03:16.430 --> 03:16.980
Everyone,

03:17.590 --> 03:18.730
please leave for now.

03:19.360 --> 03:20.850
I'll send my men to notify you all

03:21.560 --> 03:22.690
about the new gathering spot later.

03:26.030 --> 03:27.500
Let's hurry.

03:43.430 --> 03:44.410
Prince of Langya.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.220
Master Su.

03:49.360 --> 03:50.410
Master Su, please don't worry.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.260
No one tracked me on my way here.

03:52.710 --> 03:53.500
No one would know

03:53.560 --> 03:54.340
that you guys are here.

03:55.080 --> 03:56.850
Your Highness, your mentor is Mr. Li of the Academy.

03:57.710 --> 03:58.570
You were renowned for

03:58.630 --> 04:00.220
your martial arts long ago.

04:00.960 --> 04:01.980
I have no cause to worry about.

04:02.800 --> 04:03.690
Your Highness, people once called you

04:03.710 --> 04:04.980
the Elegant Gentleman.

04:05.430 --> 04:07.260
Your wits and intellect are second to none.

04:07.840 --> 04:09.660
And, your cunningness knows no bounds.

04:10.840 --> 04:11.380
Indeed.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.660
You were only willing to put your complete trust in me

04:14.000 --> 04:15.980
after I risked my life in our duel.

04:17.430 --> 04:18.340
Within Tianqi City,

04:19.000 --> 04:19.610
even a person

04:19.950 --> 04:20.610
like me

04:21.190 --> 04:21.930
has to walk every step

04:22.310 --> 04:23.730
as if I'm walking on thin ice.

04:24.680 --> 04:25.340
Therefore,

04:25.830 --> 04:26.810
I can't afford to make mistakes.

04:28.040 --> 04:28.780
Master Su,

04:29.270 --> 04:29.780
I'm sorry.

04:30.510 --> 04:31.490
I heard from Second Master

04:32.270 --> 04:33.930
that the situation at Nanjue was critical.

04:34.830 --> 04:36.140
Guardian Azure Dragon and the elite soldiers under your rule

04:36.190 --> 04:37.810
have already gone there to assist them.

04:38.600 --> 04:40.580
Guardian White Tiger was nowhere to be found.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.700
Guardian Vermilion Bird, Sikong Changfeng,

04:42.750 --> 04:44.580
returned to the martial world many years ago.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.580
Right now,

04:46.630 --> 04:48.020
only Tang Lianyue is assisting you.

04:49.120 --> 04:50.050
This should be

04:50.120 --> 04:51.220
your weakest position

04:52.240 --> 04:52.930
ever since you helped your brother

04:53.000 --> 04:53.930
to obtain the throne.

04:55.070 --> 04:55.730
Master Su,

04:56.160 --> 04:56.980
it seems

04:57.040 --> 04:58.580
you understand the situation here

04:58.870 --> 05:00.250
very well.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.900
Of course, some of them were coincidences.

05:04.190 --> 05:05.610
For example, Lei Mengsha got himself trapped.

05:06.870 --> 05:07.700
However, for some of them,

05:09.040 --> 05:10.900
I suppose you did them on purpose.

05:11.950 --> 05:13.700
You made yourself look weak on purpose.

05:14.870 --> 05:15.900
What are you waiting for?

05:23.630 --> 05:24.610
My opponents

05:24.630 --> 05:25.810
will only strike

05:26.190 --> 05:27.660
when they think I'm weak enough.

05:28.950 --> 05:29.850
And, what I desire

05:30.270 --> 05:31.100
is for them

05:31.480 --> 05:32.340
to strike me.

05:33.390 --> 05:34.850
By then, you'll require my help.

05:35.720 --> 05:36.250
Indeed.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.930
By then,

05:39.510 --> 05:40.660
I'll still be very weak.

05:41.240 --> 05:42.250
I'll be so weak

05:42.430 --> 05:43.540
that I can't even

05:43.630 --> 05:44.220
protect myself.

05:44.920 --> 05:45.980
Therefore, Master Su,

05:46.480 --> 05:47.220
I require your help

05:47.720 --> 05:48.460
for certain matters.

05:49.070 --> 05:50.050
Now that I'm looking at it,

05:51.870 --> 05:53.900
was Blood River's arrival in Tianqi City

05:55.750 --> 05:56.740
a move you planned

05:56.750 --> 05:58.580
long ago?

06:01.870 --> 06:03.250
I cannot plan a move that far ahead.

06:04.000 --> 06:05.410
I was merely following the flow.

06:06.240 --> 06:07.660
However, regarding my promise to you,

06:08.310 --> 06:09.100
I'll definitely

06:09.630 --> 06:10.340
keep it.

06:11.480 --> 06:11.930
All right.

06:15.800 --> 06:17.490
All those who were struck by the puppet poison

06:18.190 --> 06:19.170
were people of Tianqi City

06:19.270 --> 06:20.610
who possessed military strength.

06:21.310 --> 06:22.930
With this leverage,

06:23.800 --> 06:25.460
even if I have no control over them,

06:26.160 --> 06:27.170
they won't dare to act recklessly.

06:28.870 --> 06:29.460
Yong,

06:30.310 --> 06:31.700
I'll tell you this one last time.

06:32.120 --> 06:32.900
Once you make this choice,

06:33.830 --> 06:35.020
there's no turning back.

06:37.920 --> 06:38.540
Uncle,

06:39.950 --> 06:41.370
I never turn back.

06:44.190 --> 06:46.140
For all that you see when you turn back

06:47.720 --> 06:49.100
is unbearable.

07:00.480 --> 07:01.050
Mother!

07:02.800 --> 07:03.370
Mother,

07:04.240 --> 07:04.930
are you okay?

07:05.920 --> 07:07.610
Why are you still doing such needlework?

07:08.830 --> 07:09.540
I'm fine.

07:09.870 --> 07:11.900
It only pricked my finger. I'm not bleeding.

07:13.240 --> 07:13.730
Look.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.140
Your father loves

07:15.240 --> 07:16.370
the needlework I make.

07:16.870 --> 07:18.410
I made him a belt

07:18.800 --> 07:20.170
since I had nothing to do.

07:20.750 --> 07:22.140
And, I made a pair of winter boots for your uncle

07:22.390 --> 07:23.340
and grandfather each.

07:23.630 --> 07:24.290
Come, sit here.

07:26.390 --> 07:27.460
Why are you here today?

07:27.750 --> 07:29.580
Was schoolwork difficult for you?

07:30.000 --> 07:30.540
Not at all.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.580
My teacher even praised me for my intellect.

07:32.920 --> 07:33.780
When Father heard about it,

07:34.000 --> 07:35.410
he granted me a set of scholar's tools.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.250
There's no school today.

07:37.830 --> 07:39.020
That's why I came back to visit you.

07:40.000 --> 07:40.700
Good boy.

07:41.390 --> 07:42.580
Will Father be coming here today?

07:47.870 --> 07:48.660
Perhaps.

07:51.630 --> 07:52.140
Your Highness,

07:52.560 --> 07:53.980
please make a plea on Her Highness's behalf.

07:54.680 --> 07:56.410
Now, His Majesty visits Consort Xuan every day.

07:56.800 --> 07:58.250
It's been so long since he visited us.

07:58.870 --> 08:00.460
You're his first child.

08:00.830 --> 08:02.460
His Majesty doted on you the most in the past.

08:02.800 --> 08:03.610
- You should... - Diancui!

08:04.680 --> 08:05.220
That was unnecessary.

08:10.040 --> 08:11.220
Pay no heed to her words.

08:11.720 --> 08:12.540
Study well

08:12.920 --> 08:13.900
and make me proud.

08:18.040 --> 08:18.540
Your Highness!

08:18.830 --> 08:19.980
Your Highness, we're in trouble!

08:21.160 --> 08:21.610
Your Highness,

08:22.070 --> 08:23.370
there's something wrong with the Ministry of Revenue's accounts,

08:23.510 --> 08:24.460
which were under Lord Dian's supervision.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.340
His Majesty is enraged.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.460
He intends to punish him!

08:30.060 --> 08:35.380
[Dian's Residence]

08:37.900 --> 08:39.980
[Dian's Residence]

08:43.480 --> 08:44.850
I suppose your father still has a conscience.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.730
He merely ordered your grandfather to retire.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.130
Perhaps

08:50.550 --> 08:51.530
Father was lenient with him

08:51.750 --> 08:53.180
as Mother belonged to the Dian family.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.610
I suppose he wouldn't bother

08:55.390 --> 08:56.940
to finish off a lone stray dog.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.490
But Yong, don't worry.

08:59.870 --> 09:00.940
I'm joining the military

09:01.360 --> 09:02.100
to fork out a new path

09:02.150 --> 09:03.100
for our family.

09:04.000 --> 09:05.340
I will become your new source of strength.

09:06.120 --> 09:06.890
You must look after your mother

09:07.550 --> 09:08.580
in Tianqi.

09:44.910 --> 09:45.420
Yong,

09:47.200 --> 09:48.300
you're the only kin

09:48.720 --> 09:49.820
I have.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.490
Uncle, you're also

09:55.390 --> 09:57.180
the only blade I can hold

09:58.840 --> 10:00.770
without injuring myself.

10:04.000 --> 10:04.530
Your Highness,

10:05.320 --> 10:06.490
Xuanwu Guardian and the members of Blood River

10:07.080 --> 10:08.180
have headed to Doom Abyss together.

10:08.720 --> 10:10.010
Blood River again?

10:11.200 --> 10:12.650
Su Changhe already agreed to

10:12.670 --> 10:13.610
join hands with us.

10:15.000 --> 10:15.940
Why is Blood River

10:16.840 --> 10:18.730
still obstructing us from executing our plans?

10:21.720 --> 10:22.250
Haoyue.

10:22.960 --> 10:24.100
Go and find Su Changhe.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.130
If he continues to be on his retreat,

10:26.790 --> 10:27.940
our cooperation

10:29.030 --> 10:30.180
will be called off.

10:31.030 --> 10:32.130
By then, we shall

10:32.200 --> 10:34.100
eradicate

10:35.200 --> 10:36.610
every single Blood River member

10:37.150 --> 10:38.460
in Tianqi City.

10:39.440 --> 10:39.940
Yes, Your Highness.

10:40.360 --> 10:40.980
Your Highness.

10:45.480 --> 10:46.730
Why don't you send me there?

10:47.150 --> 10:49.010
After all, if you trace back to our roots,

10:49.550 --> 10:50.820
I suppose I'm a part of them as well.

10:52.720 --> 10:53.340
That'll do.

10:54.080 --> 10:54.610
Besides that,

10:55.200 --> 10:56.180
try to locate

10:56.320 --> 10:58.180
the current hiding spot of Su Muyu and his men.

10:58.550 --> 10:59.300
You may eradicate them

10:59.840 --> 11:01.610
without notifying Su Changhe

11:02.870 --> 11:05.580
when it's necessary.

11:10.840 --> 11:11.490
How did it go?

11:13.000 --> 11:13.580
Yu,

11:14.270 --> 11:15.370
we've already found out about the secret

11:15.370 --> 11:16.220
behind the drugged puppets in Tianqi City.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.610
However, our opponents were too strong.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.490
We had no choice but to retreat.

11:19.000 --> 11:19.890
Yumo and Tang Lianyue

11:20.200 --> 11:21.490
have already returned to Prince of Langya's Manor to report back.

11:21.960 --> 11:22.580
Su Muyu,

11:23.080 --> 11:23.850
we should leave for now.

11:24.200 --> 11:25.700
The situation in Tianqi City is much more complicated than we thought.

11:26.240 --> 11:26.770
I don't think

11:27.150 --> 11:28.220
this is worth it.

11:40.550 --> 11:41.100
Xuewei,

11:41.550 --> 11:42.340
go and ask Changli

11:42.870 --> 11:44.180
about Changhe's retreat.

11:45.630 --> 11:46.220
Yu,

11:47.150 --> 11:48.100
do you intend to give up as well?

11:48.960 --> 11:49.700
I don't want people

11:49.750 --> 11:51.490
to use Blood River as a political tool.

11:53.320 --> 11:54.460
You guys may leave with Miss Bai first.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.420
I'll wait for Changhe's news.

11:57.030 --> 11:58.220
We'll return to Blood River

11:59.200 --> 12:00.130
after I rendezvous with him.

12:01.270 --> 12:01.850
Yu,

12:02.790 --> 12:04.220
you're still the same.

12:04.870 --> 12:05.700
You don't know how to lie at all.

12:08.630 --> 12:10.060
You want us to take Miss Bai with us

12:10.510 --> 12:11.850
while you'll clean up the mess yourself.

12:13.440 --> 12:14.100
I can't afford to leave.

12:16.840 --> 12:17.420
Miss Bai.

12:18.120 --> 12:18.700
Why is that the case?

12:19.320 --> 12:20.650
Tianqi City is facing turmoil

12:20.840 --> 12:21.530
due to the drugged puppets.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.300
And, the puppet spell was developed by

12:23.790 --> 12:25.820
an outcast of Medicine King Valley.

12:26.470 --> 12:28.730
Right now, I have the highest seniority among its members.

12:29.390 --> 12:30.300
I can't just leave without doing anything.

12:32.360 --> 12:33.010
But now,

12:33.510 --> 12:34.530
the Patriarch is on a reclusive retreat.

12:35.150 --> 12:35.850
Master Su

12:36.080 --> 12:36.850
is also heavily wounded.

12:37.390 --> 12:38.220
With our strength,

12:38.600 --> 12:39.850
I'm afraid we won't be able to contribute much

12:40.320 --> 12:41.340
on this battlefield.

12:45.030 --> 12:45.890
Who said so?

12:46.200 --> 12:46.730
Fadog?

12:51.480 --> 12:51.980
Fadog.

12:52.270 --> 12:52.770
Uncle Zhe.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.370
I'm here for you, my girl.

12:58.120 --> 12:59.300
Who actually wounded you?

13:00.080 --> 13:01.490
I'm going to rip him to shreds.

13:02.790 --> 13:03.850
Fadog, you're too late.

13:04.670 --> 13:05.580
Su Muyu

13:06.480 --> 13:07.580
already avenged me.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.300
You brat.

13:11.750 --> 13:12.530
Good job.

13:18.150 --> 13:18.730
Your Highness.

13:21.360 --> 13:23.340
Ms. Yumo, I've long heard of your name.

13:23.670 --> 13:24.340
But this is

13:24.550 --> 13:25.890
our first encounter.

13:26.440 --> 13:27.730
Initially, I wanted to see you

13:28.080 --> 13:28.940
when Blood River came to Tianqi.

13:29.510 --> 13:30.130
It's just that...

13:30.390 --> 13:31.060
It's just

13:31.120 --> 13:32.180
that Lianyue wasn't around back then.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.890
Therefore, there was no need to see me.

13:37.360 --> 13:38.700
Your Highness, you're quite humorous.

13:39.480 --> 13:39.980
Please have a seat.

13:40.360 --> 13:41.010
Thank you, Your Highness.

13:48.910 --> 13:50.010
I came from the Academy.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.940
Back then, Master told us

13:52.200 --> 13:53.490
that being interesting

13:53.870 --> 13:55.490
could attract girls better

13:55.600 --> 13:57.220
than being powerful.

13:57.960 --> 13:58.820
Therefore,

13:59.080 --> 14:00.340
everyone was interesting

14:00.440 --> 14:01.340
in their own way.

14:02.150 --> 14:03.490
Lianyue lived with the Tang Clan since young.

14:03.870 --> 14:04.980
He was

14:05.120 --> 14:06.340
already uninteresting

14:06.390 --> 14:07.300
when he got to know us.

14:08.390 --> 14:09.370
And, I couldn't change him

14:09.550 --> 14:10.610
even after all these years.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.180
Therefore, Ms. Yumo,

14:13.360 --> 14:14.250
I wonder

14:14.510 --> 14:15.650
what you like about him.

14:22.000 --> 14:22.820
I used to like him.

14:23.150 --> 14:23.940
But now,

14:24.630 --> 14:25.300
I no longer like him.

14:26.840 --> 14:28.220
Why is that the case?

14:29.360 --> 14:30.300
He's too timid.

14:30.670 --> 14:32.130
I like bold men.

14:33.120 --> 14:33.850
For example,

14:35.200 --> 14:36.730
a valiant man such as yourself, Your Highness.

14:45.480 --> 14:45.940
Your Highness!

15:01.270 --> 15:02.100
Ms. Yumo,

15:02.840 --> 15:03.460
Lianyue is a good man

15:03.870 --> 15:05.850
whom you can entrust yourself to.

15:06.120 --> 15:07.060
Not me.

15:08.870 --> 15:09.850
Your Highness, what do you mean?

15:10.600 --> 15:12.220
It's because among the men I know,

15:12.720 --> 15:13.650
Lianyue is the only man

15:14.550 --> 15:15.770
who will not change a single bit

15:15.960 --> 15:17.020
when he's sure

15:17.020 --> 15:18.610
that he can

15:18.840 --> 15:20.130
provide you

15:20.270 --> 15:22.180
with a lifetime of happiness,

15:22.390 --> 15:23.340
unless he dies.

15:24.840 --> 15:25.700
Only then

15:26.390 --> 15:28.220
will he dedicate his true feelings to you.

15:29.960 --> 15:30.820
Other people

15:31.270 --> 15:31.770
cannot do so.

15:34.870 --> 15:35.300
Your Highness,

15:36.440 --> 15:37.770
this isn't the time for this.

15:40.120 --> 15:41.730
Master once told me

15:42.240 --> 15:44.180
that discussions of relationship

15:44.270 --> 15:45.730
are suitable

15:45.840 --> 15:46.850
no matter when we initiate the conversation.

15:47.750 --> 15:48.940
The Imperial Assembly will be held soon.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.060
But coincidentally, many of the sons of noblemen

15:51.390 --> 15:52.220
were struck by the puppet poison

15:52.270 --> 15:53.100
at this particular timing.

15:53.910 --> 15:54.650
It's obvious

15:55.510 --> 15:57.010
that First Prince is plotting something.

15:57.840 --> 15:59.180
And, rumors about you have been circulating

15:59.630 --> 16:00.820
around Tianqi City.

16:01.910 --> 16:03.180
I'm sure he's targeting us.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.370
Actually, I think

16:07.750 --> 16:09.530
both have their own merits.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.530
One of them can express his love at any time.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.730
He expresses it in a direct

16:12.910 --> 16:13.610
and carefree manner.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.610
Therefore, it's always ferocious

16:16.320 --> 16:18.010
at the start.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.370
As for the other one, he only expresses his love

16:20.440 --> 16:21.940
after everything has settled down.

16:22.750 --> 16:24.300
It always feels a bit too calm.

16:25.600 --> 16:27.100
Therefore, the beautiful lady has

16:27.150 --> 16:28.300
to endure more hardships.

16:30.750 --> 16:31.300
However,

16:31.840 --> 16:32.460
Lianyue

16:32.960 --> 16:34.340
is a great man.

16:44.720 --> 16:45.490
Your Highness,

16:46.200 --> 16:47.250
what's with the eccentric speech?

16:48.080 --> 16:48.610
It's as if you...

16:48.750 --> 16:49.220
Yumo.

16:52.000 --> 16:52.610
Do not spout nonsense.

16:53.440 --> 16:54.730
You knew what I was going to say, didn't you?

16:55.240 --> 16:56.220
If so, how can that be considered nonsense?

16:57.840 --> 16:58.820
Do you mean

17:00.030 --> 17:01.490
as if I'm telling you my last will?

17:03.200 --> 17:03.940
Perhaps

17:04.680 --> 17:06.180
I am telling you my last will.

17:06.240 --> 17:06.730
Your Highness!

17:09.000 --> 17:09.810
Forget it.

17:11.270 --> 17:12.490
What did you say again?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.900
You said many sons of noblemen

17:15.070 --> 17:16.290
were struck by the puppet poison.

17:19.440 --> 17:20.660
Which family do they come from?

17:21.110 --> 17:22.290
We only managed to identify some of them.

17:22.830 --> 17:23.570
We haven't identified the rest.

17:26.680 --> 17:27.530
Why did you come back, then?

17:27.790 --> 17:28.420
Go and find them.

17:28.790 --> 17:30.140
Find every single one of them.

17:30.510 --> 17:31.390
Protect them all.

17:31.390 --> 17:33.220
After that, figure out a way to neutralize the poison.

17:34.440 --> 17:35.220
But remember,

17:35.550 --> 17:36.530
you must finish these operations

17:36.720 --> 17:37.730
as soon as possible.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.570
If not, things will go south

17:40.070 --> 17:42.090
when their fathers and brothers gather at Tianqi

17:42.720 --> 17:44.220
for the Imperial Assembly.

17:45.590 --> 17:46.330
Perhaps

17:46.550 --> 17:48.570
something worse will happen.

17:49.720 --> 17:50.090
Understood.

18:10.480 --> 18:11.090
Changhe,

18:11.750 --> 18:13.570
are we going to die here?

18:14.550 --> 18:15.140
That won't happen.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.090
I'll surely take you with me

18:17.160 --> 18:18.220
and escape from here.

18:18.880 --> 18:20.090
What about Mother and the rest?

18:21.310 --> 18:23.330
Can we still rescue them?

18:23.960 --> 18:24.530
We can.

18:26.480 --> 18:27.700
Both of us will survive.

18:33.750 --> 18:34.290
Changhe.

18:34.590 --> 18:35.140
Changli?

18:35.680 --> 18:36.250
Are you okay?

18:37.070 --> 18:37.730
Changhe,

18:38.030 --> 18:39.140
you should go.

18:39.830 --> 18:41.290
Just leave me behind.

18:42.070 --> 18:44.250
I'm bleeding so much.

18:44.640 --> 18:47.220
I don't think I can survive!

18:47.480 --> 18:47.860
No.

18:47.920 --> 18:49.290
Just go!

18:49.880 --> 18:51.090
Just go!

18:57.110 --> 18:58.540
Go!

18:58.540 --> 18:59.420
Changhe!

18:59.790 --> 19:01.020
Just go!

19:01.240 --> 19:03.370
Just leave me behind!

19:03.440 --> 19:04.090
Changhe!

19:04.200 --> 19:05.140
Go!

19:05.240 --> 19:06.180
Changli!

19:09.070 --> 19:10.010
Changhe!

19:30.550 --> 19:31.140
This time,

19:34.270 --> 19:34.860
we're not running away.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.250
Ignorant fool,

19:47.030 --> 19:49.010
it seems you have a death wish.

19:59.960 --> 20:01.220
Who would have the nerve before the King of Hell

20:02.510 --> 20:04.380
to make me face death?

20:15.830 --> 20:17.050
Even the King of Hell

20:17.720 --> 20:19.570
distances himself from me when he sees me!

20:42.000 --> 20:42.730
Finally.

21:00.070 --> 21:01.180
Didn't I already tell you?

21:01.400 --> 21:02.860
Changhe is in a reclusive retreat.

21:03.070 --> 21:04.330
No one is to enter his chamber.

21:06.750 --> 21:07.570
In a reclusive retreat?

21:09.160 --> 21:11.220
Your Patriarch promises to form an alliance with us.

21:12.030 --> 21:13.010
But he disappeared

21:13.160 --> 21:14.220
after making the deal.

21:15.350 --> 21:16.660
And, the rest of Blood River

21:17.350 --> 21:19.180
is obstructing us from executing our plan too.

21:20.510 --> 21:21.620
It's all because

21:21.860 --> 21:23.380
Changhe received a blow from Prince of Langya back then.

21:23.680 --> 21:24.530
He sustained internal injury.

21:29.590 --> 21:30.380
Could it be...

21:31.790 --> 21:32.570
I heard

21:33.200 --> 21:35.420
that every level of the Hell Palm

21:36.480 --> 21:38.140
unveils a new world.

21:38.680 --> 21:40.380
Once one reaches the ninth level,

21:40.750 --> 21:41.980
one can form his own world.

21:42.960 --> 21:44.180
This is my first time

21:44.640 --> 21:45.620
witnessing

21:45.680 --> 21:47.900
a cultivator who has reached the ninth level of Hell Palm.

21:50.830 --> 21:51.770
It's you, old man.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.700
Patriarch of Blood River,

21:58.270 --> 22:00.050
we have met again.

22:03.350 --> 22:04.980
It seems you guys joined First Prince's faction

22:05.030 --> 22:06.250
after leaving Shadow Sect.

22:10.240 --> 22:12.250
I knew I had the right mindset back then.

22:12.830 --> 22:13.660
I should've gotten rid of

22:13.680 --> 22:15.290
all my opponents.

22:16.000 --> 22:16.810
I wonder

22:16.960 --> 22:18.380
if Muyu would regret his decision

22:19.310 --> 22:20.220
if he could see this.

22:21.790 --> 22:22.730
If we wish

22:22.790 --> 22:24.700
to remain in Tianqi for a long time,

22:25.550 --> 22:27.980
we have to find a worthy master to depend on.

22:28.790 --> 22:30.070
His Highness

22:30.110 --> 22:31.620
is quite a good option.

22:32.160 --> 22:32.730
If not,

22:33.000 --> 22:34.180
why would you and I

22:34.590 --> 22:35.860
encounter each other

22:35.960 --> 22:36.700
here?

22:36.960 --> 22:37.570
What do you think?

22:40.030 --> 22:41.050
Now that the deed is over,

22:42.270 --> 22:44.660
the Three Families of Tianqi

22:45.000 --> 22:46.010
and Blood River

22:46.640 --> 22:49.140
are willing to acknowledge you as the Patriarch.

22:49.960 --> 22:51.860
Once His Highness ascends the throne,

22:53.350 --> 22:55.140
we shall replace

22:55.200 --> 22:56.570
the current Inner Security Division

22:57.440 --> 22:59.730
and walk in the sunlight officially.

23:03.310 --> 23:03.900
Let's go.

23:05.200 --> 23:07.490
It's been quite some time since I last met His Highness.

23:08.480 --> 23:09.530
Now that I've reached

23:09.590 --> 23:10.860
the ninth level of Hell Palm,

23:11.920 --> 23:13.460
I wonder who will

23:14.720 --> 23:15.530
be the first

23:15.640 --> 23:16.620
to have a taste of it.

23:26.960 --> 23:28.010
Lianyue was meant to live beneath

23:29.030 --> 23:31.290
the open skies of the martial world.

23:34.070 --> 23:35.490
Does one become more talkative

23:36.160 --> 23:37.330
as they accumulate more life experiences?

23:38.510 --> 23:39.900
You're the same as Sikong Changfeng.

23:40.270 --> 23:41.290
You two like to express your sentiments

23:41.790 --> 23:42.900
while admiring a gorgeous view.

23:46.240 --> 23:48.140
You and I have plucked the same number of flowers and leaves.

23:49.640 --> 23:50.570
But among your harvest,

23:52.550 --> 23:53.460
there are three pieces of peach blossom leaves.

23:55.310 --> 23:55.940
Therefore,

23:57.000 --> 23:57.730
you've lost.

23:58.920 --> 23:59.530
Forget it.

24:00.920 --> 24:02.700
Deliver this message to Sikong Changfeng on my behalf.

24:03.550 --> 24:04.660
I'm going to head to Tianqi.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.490
I'm not sure when I'll return.

24:10.550 --> 24:11.900
I suppose the life I was leading

24:12.590 --> 24:13.570
was too restrained.

24:13.830 --> 24:15.090
That's why I'm feeling sentimental

24:15.680 --> 24:16.770
now that it has come to this.

24:17.350 --> 24:18.900
I suppose a life like yours

24:19.720 --> 24:20.460
is great.

24:21.400 --> 24:22.220
You lead a carefree life.

24:24.550 --> 24:26.290
Your mother sent you here to protect me in secret.

24:27.240 --> 24:27.940
Sorry for the trouble.

24:30.310 --> 24:32.050
So, do you regret the decision you made?

24:44.680 --> 24:45.620
If, one day,

24:46.070 --> 24:47.250
you encounter an expert,

24:47.960 --> 24:49.810
and you have a chance to challenge him to a duel,

24:50.750 --> 24:52.490
but you'll fail and won't be able to wield the sword again

24:52.920 --> 24:54.770
if you challenge him.

24:56.680 --> 24:57.530
Will you regret the fact

24:58.110 --> 24:59.420
that you challenged him to a duel?

25:00.750 --> 25:01.250
I won't.

25:06.750 --> 25:08.220
That is also my answer.

25:09.240 --> 25:11.180
Life is just like the Peach Blossom Coin

25:11.750 --> 25:13.290
used for divination on Mount Wangcheng.

25:13.960 --> 25:15.490
Only one side can face upward.

25:16.270 --> 25:18.010
If I want to lead a serene life,

25:18.400 --> 25:20.330
I have to cast away the carefree martial world life.

25:20.880 --> 25:22.770
If you wish to experience peerless swordsmanship,

25:23.720 --> 25:26.380
you have to bear the consequences of challenging him.

25:27.880 --> 25:28.570
That's frustrating.

25:29.350 --> 25:30.290
What I meant was

25:31.510 --> 25:32.530
I won't lose to him.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.220
If so,

25:40.480 --> 25:41.810
I shall head to Pleasure House first.

25:43.590 --> 25:44.290
Beauty,

25:44.440 --> 25:45.730
I'll go and enjoy your performance again when I'm free.

25:47.550 --> 25:48.810
Sir, I'll surely reserve a good seat

25:48.920 --> 25:49.660
for you.

25:58.070 --> 25:58.530
Boss.

26:03.000 --> 26:03.700
You guys are here as well.

26:04.680 --> 26:05.900
You instructed Patriarch to tell us

26:06.200 --> 26:06.980
that we no longer need to be

26:07.030 --> 26:08.220
the masked Twelve Zodiacs.

26:08.640 --> 26:09.570
But fighting by your side

26:09.920 --> 26:11.180
is something exciting.

26:12.030 --> 26:12.460
Therefore,

26:13.110 --> 26:13.660
we've returned.

26:17.110 --> 26:18.180
Your new blade looks great.

26:20.830 --> 26:22.090
I retrieved this from Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

26:23.160 --> 26:24.010
It cuts through iron like butter.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.090
Boss,

26:26.310 --> 26:26.980
don't worry.

26:27.310 --> 26:28.090
Our martial arts

26:28.270 --> 26:29.420
have improved quite a lot as well.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.380
Could we leave Tianqi City right now

26:39.510 --> 26:41.050
if we didn't listen to that lass?

26:43.200 --> 26:43.900
If it's possible,

26:45.920 --> 26:47.530
Uncle Zhe, I hope you can take Miss Bai with you.

26:49.240 --> 26:50.290
As for the affairs of Tianqi City,

26:51.550 --> 26:52.730
allow Changhe and me to deal with them.

27:05.590 --> 27:06.980
If that's the case,

27:08.110 --> 27:09.090
I don't think it'll work.

27:11.440 --> 27:12.700
Look at your current state.

27:13.270 --> 27:14.140
What do you think you can do?

27:15.310 --> 27:16.860
If you don't want your body

27:16.920 --> 27:18.770
to be riddled with holes, just like mine,

27:19.400 --> 27:20.420
the best way is for you

27:21.030 --> 27:22.140
to stop using martial arts

27:22.960 --> 27:24.140
and rest and recuperate under my daughter's care

27:24.480 --> 27:25.380
for a few months.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.700
Only then will you be able to recover completely.

27:28.590 --> 27:29.700
I'll try to recover as soon as possible.

27:30.790 --> 27:31.700
Uncle Zhe, please don't worry.

27:33.640 --> 27:34.380
How could I?

27:35.310 --> 27:36.620
You and I suffered the same type of injury.

27:37.790 --> 27:38.900
I could tell this at first glance.

27:40.070 --> 27:40.860
The current you is...

27:44.720 --> 27:45.940
If a breeze were to come right now,

27:46.830 --> 27:47.940
you'll dissipate like

27:47.960 --> 27:48.660
the incense smoke.

27:50.310 --> 27:51.660
Uncle Zhe, not only did you survive,

27:52.960 --> 27:53.570
but you also retained

27:53.640 --> 27:54.730
your reign as the top martial artist of Su family.

27:56.200 --> 27:57.330
I know this better than you.

28:04.790 --> 28:05.770
If the current me

28:07.030 --> 28:09.620
has to fight with my all,

28:10.750 --> 28:12.860
if I have to fight with someone on equal terms as I,

28:13.510 --> 28:14.900
I'll surely die from it.

28:15.720 --> 28:17.220
That's the consequence of the grave injury

28:17.640 --> 28:18.940
I sustained back then.

28:19.640 --> 28:21.140
Even Xin Baicao

28:21.510 --> 28:22.770
won't be able to treat my condition.

28:27.070 --> 28:27.810
I wish

28:28.240 --> 28:29.730
to entrust my daughter to you in the future.

28:30.440 --> 28:32.770
Therefore, I don't want you to end up like me.

28:35.240 --> 28:35.770
Uncle Zhe.

28:38.110 --> 28:39.140
I have my own plans.

28:40.960 --> 28:41.980
My foot!

28:44.920 --> 28:46.050
Your final plan

28:46.510 --> 28:47.900
is to forfeit your own life.

28:48.550 --> 28:49.420
If she gets together with someone like you,

28:49.920 --> 28:51.180
she'll become a widow in the end.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.330
But I suppose we don't have a choice.

28:56.750 --> 28:57.730
That's the person you are.

28:58.920 --> 29:00.290
That's why you're Su Muyu.

29:04.790 --> 29:05.810
Since both you and my daughter

29:06.480 --> 29:07.810
have already decided,

29:08.640 --> 29:09.290
let me

29:10.440 --> 29:11.460
do you a favor.

29:13.680 --> 29:14.290
Uncle Zhe, you mustn't.

29:14.750 --> 29:15.620
Why not?

29:20.440 --> 29:21.380
If you use this art,

29:21.790 --> 29:23.250
you'll receive a serious backlash!

29:23.440 --> 29:24.090
Don't worry.

29:24.640 --> 29:25.620
I won't die yet.

29:26.270 --> 29:27.460
I'll live on

29:27.960 --> 29:28.940
so that I can look after my daughter.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.180
Su Muyu.

29:33.000 --> 29:33.940
You don't have a choice.

29:34.160 --> 29:35.660
You have to accept my zhenqi.

29:36.200 --> 29:37.810
If not, I'll die

29:38.400 --> 29:39.530
from exhausting all of my zhenqi.

29:57.310 --> 29:57.940
Su Muyu,

30:00.000 --> 30:01.140
once you overcome this ordeal,

30:02.590 --> 30:03.570
you should leave the martial world.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.490
Leave the martial world?

30:07.510 --> 30:08.220
For example,

30:09.160 --> 30:09.980
you can return to Nan'an City.

30:10.790 --> 30:12.940
You can be a medical apprentice for the rest of your life.

30:13.830 --> 30:14.730
You can help my daughter

30:15.440 --> 30:16.010
to sell,

30:16.480 --> 30:17.050
crush,

30:17.400 --> 30:17.980
and brew herbs.

30:19.960 --> 30:21.220
Once the sun sets,

30:22.720 --> 30:23.810
you can make a bowl

30:24.310 --> 30:25.530
of terrible noodles for her.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.330
After that, my daughter

30:30.000 --> 30:30.900
will reprimand you

30:31.310 --> 30:32.730
while she finishes the noodles.

30:33.750 --> 30:34.420
You will

30:35.030 --> 30:35.810
feel embarrassed over it.

30:36.200 --> 30:37.380
The next morning,

30:37.790 --> 30:39.010
you'll go and buy osmanthus cakes for her.

30:41.030 --> 30:42.180
Don't you think

30:42.960 --> 30:44.010
that's pretty nice?

30:46.960 --> 30:48.250
I can't just make terrible noodles for her

30:48.310 --> 30:49.140
for the rest of my life.

30:51.550 --> 30:52.660
I'm sure you like it as well.

30:53.880 --> 30:54.980
I can live in Nan'an City.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.620
I can lead a peaceful life there.

31:00.030 --> 31:01.250
But what about the members of Blood River?

31:04.350 --> 31:05.810
If they are allowed to roam free across the martial world,

31:07.920 --> 31:09.140
they'll eventually die

31:12.030 --> 31:13.460
where no one can find them.

31:16.310 --> 31:18.140
You're a responsible man.

31:19.000 --> 31:20.090
Uncle Zhe, I believe

31:20.110 --> 31:21.330
that you were once a responsible man as well.

31:22.640 --> 31:24.140
After all, you're the former Kui.

31:24.880 --> 31:26.290
And, you're from the main family.

31:27.350 --> 31:29.010
You were supposed to inherit the title of Patriarch.

31:30.110 --> 31:31.050
I guess so.

31:32.270 --> 31:33.140
Back then,

31:34.240 --> 31:35.700
I had lofty aspirations.

31:36.830 --> 31:37.700
I merely wanted

31:37.790 --> 31:38.940
to make my name known throughout the world.

31:39.790 --> 31:41.730
I wanted to fight for the world's number one title.

31:43.640 --> 31:44.330
What happened after that?

31:44.960 --> 31:45.660
After that,

31:49.400 --> 31:50.380
I found love.

31:51.640 --> 31:52.420
Since then, I have only wished

31:53.070 --> 31:53.860
to leave the martial world

31:54.440 --> 31:55.330
and lead a secluded life with her.

31:56.350 --> 31:57.250
Blood River,

31:57.590 --> 31:58.530
and the martial world,

31:59.640 --> 32:01.480
none of them was as enticing as

32:01.880 --> 32:02.900
watching a sky full of stars with her.

32:03.830 --> 32:04.380
You're inferior

32:05.200 --> 32:06.180
to me.

32:07.030 --> 32:07.980
It seems like

32:08.640 --> 32:09.660
I'm the best man

32:09.960 --> 32:10.730
in the world.

32:16.070 --> 32:16.620
Fadog,

32:17.000 --> 32:17.730
what are you doing?

32:21.830 --> 32:23.090
This should be the Divine-Demon Nirvana Art.

32:23.960 --> 32:24.530
Rumor has it

32:25.270 --> 32:25.810
that when one

32:25.830 --> 32:26.700
has sustained grave injuries,

32:27.160 --> 32:28.140
they can exchange their life for another.

32:28.960 --> 32:29.810
Although it has been modified,

32:30.310 --> 32:31.700
and the user won't die from it,

32:32.000 --> 32:32.620
the user

32:33.000 --> 32:34.330
will receive a serious backlash.

32:36.070 --> 32:37.250
Uncle Zhe has truly given his all

32:38.640 --> 32:39.860
for Su Muyu's sake.

32:55.960 --> 32:57.900
I heard that Tianqi City hasn't been peaceful

32:58.680 --> 32:59.620
recently.

33:00.480 --> 33:03.420
Assassins attacked Flying Tiger General's Residence at night.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.490
It was quite the commotion.

33:06.310 --> 33:07.490
Dian Ye?

33:08.830 --> 33:10.330
Who has he offended?

33:11.000 --> 33:11.770
I have

33:12.510 --> 33:13.770
no idea.

33:15.030 --> 33:15.730
I think

33:16.510 --> 33:17.860
it's some martial artists.

33:20.480 --> 33:21.570
Martial artists, huh?

33:25.160 --> 33:26.460
If that's the case,

33:28.000 --> 33:29.700
shouldn't we ask Ruofeng about it?

33:30.750 --> 33:32.050
It seems those martial artists

33:33.030 --> 33:36.010
are Prince of Langya's acquaintances.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.420
Martial artists like them

33:43.550 --> 33:45.140
actually dared to attack a general

33:45.160 --> 33:46.700
in Tianqi, huh?

33:48.880 --> 33:51.220
They're too bold for their own good.

33:51.920 --> 33:52.860
Relay my order to Dian Ye.

33:53.440 --> 33:54.660
I'm granting him permission

33:55.030 --> 33:56.620
to conduct a citywide manhunt for the assassins.

33:57.160 --> 33:59.730
He can dispatch as many of the elite troops under him.

34:00.680 --> 34:01.900
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.420
Now, I've reached the ninth level

34:04.480 --> 34:05.810
of Hell Palm.

34:06.310 --> 34:08.010
It feels as if the vast world

34:08.070 --> 34:09.210
is but the size of my palm now.

34:10.280 --> 34:11.050
By the way, old man,

34:12.760 --> 34:13.820
were you unable

34:14.280 --> 34:15.740
to reach the ninth level of Hell Palm

34:15.800 --> 34:17.010
even after all these years?

34:19.150 --> 34:20.530
The Hell Palm the Three Families of Tianqi practices

34:20.800 --> 34:22.690
is different from the one

34:23.320 --> 34:25.610
you guys are practicing.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.820
The arts and manuals we have

34:27.880 --> 34:28.740
are incomplete.

34:29.190 --> 34:31.130
We can only reach the eighth level at most.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.170
Even if you and I were on the same level,

34:33.400 --> 34:35.210
I will be inferior to you.

34:35.880 --> 34:36.940
I see.

34:38.030 --> 34:38.940
I thought

34:39.000 --> 34:39.900
you were merely ungifted.

34:43.800 --> 34:45.420
I suppose that's correct as well.

34:46.670 --> 34:47.610
But Patriarch,

34:47.880 --> 34:48.650
do you know why

34:49.070 --> 34:50.530
the Three Families of Tianqi

34:50.760 --> 34:52.090
only have incomplete arts

34:52.320 --> 34:53.340
and manuals?

34:53.960 --> 34:54.820
Please tell me about it.

34:56.230 --> 34:57.420
It's because Hell Palm

34:57.420 --> 34:59.490
is a sinister art.

34:59.800 --> 35:00.650
Those who reach the highest level

35:00.880 --> 35:02.210
will receive a serious backlash.

35:03.510 --> 35:04.940
Therefore, the manuals

35:05.000 --> 35:05.940
we had in Tianqi City

35:06.000 --> 35:07.170
were modified.

35:07.480 --> 35:08.820
We cannot utilize

35:08.920 --> 35:09.780
all of their power.

35:10.320 --> 35:11.650
As for those in Blood River,

35:12.030 --> 35:14.050
the original copy was kept within your organization

35:14.480 --> 35:16.900
in order to seek out more power.

35:27.000 --> 35:28.130
Long time no see,

35:29.000 --> 35:29.820
Patriarch.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.170
Do you know

35:32.710 --> 35:34.460
what happened when you were away

35:35.230 --> 35:36.210
on your reclusive retreat?

35:36.840 --> 35:38.050
I heard that my friends at Blood River

35:38.110 --> 35:38.980
almost died.

35:40.150 --> 35:42.210
The head of Su family almost died as well.

35:43.070 --> 35:44.340
As for He-Yu Clinic,

35:44.360 --> 35:45.980
it was almost leveled overnight.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.050
Do you guys know

35:48.880 --> 35:49.940
that I'm furious right now?

35:51.590 --> 35:53.010
It's all because you all were messing around.

35:53.070 --> 35:53.650
Messing around?

35:56.030 --> 35:56.780
Sir Zhuo Qing,

35:57.190 --> 35:58.570
say, what if I mess around

35:58.670 --> 36:00.070
and kill the prince in front of me

36:00.070 --> 36:01.050
with one blow?

36:01.630 --> 36:02.460
Will you be able to stop me?

36:04.760 --> 36:05.420
Such audacity!

36:12.670 --> 36:14.300
If it were the past version of you,

36:14.760 --> 36:17.010
there was no way you could achieve that.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.690
However, if it's the current you we're talking about,

36:21.480 --> 36:23.210
there's a 50% chance

36:23.670 --> 36:25.530
you'll be able to take Yong's life.

36:27.110 --> 36:28.340
Should I give it a try?

36:31.540 --> 36:35.020
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

36:35.060 --> 36:38.940
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

36:40.780 --> 36:44.260
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

36:44.300 --> 36:48.140
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:50.140 --> 36:53.420
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:53.540 --> 36:55.620
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:55.780 --> 36:59.220
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:59.700 --> 37:01.900
♪My heart no longer my own♪

37:02.020 --> 37:07.020
♪No one can escape from love♪

37:23.620 --> 37:27.340
♪How many hidden feelings♪

37:27.460 --> 37:31.540
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

37:32.780 --> 37:36.660
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

37:36.780 --> 37:41.020
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

37:42.140 --> 37:45.020
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

37:45.100 --> 37:49.340
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

37:51.620 --> 37:55.620
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

